    "title": "Screen Recorder Video Recorder",
    "description": "This is a powerful and free screen recorder. You can easy to make high quality screen recorder, screen captures and share to your friends. \r\n\r\n\r\nKey Features\r\n\ud83c\udf1fScreen recorder with internal audio\r\n\ud83c\udf1fSupport Samsung, Motorola, Xiaomi, Vivo, OPPO, Huawei etc. \r\n\ud83c\udf1fHigh quality clear recording. No more worry about resolution issues anymore.\r\n\ud83c\udf1fNo record time limited. You can freely to record as long as you want.\r\n\u2705Support most popular video steam media, including YouTube, Tiktok, Live Stream, Games. \r\n\u2705Video Editor to trim video easily.\r\nMultiple video recording settings options, including fps, resolution, Horizontal and vertical screen.\r\n\u2705Screenshot and capture that allow you get screenshot easily.\r\n\u2705Floating widget and notification bar help you record more convenient.\r\nOne click to share record videos.\r\n\u2705No Root Needed.\r\nFurthermore, more powerful functions are developing.\r\n\r\nTwo ways to record screen:\r\n1.Turn on the Floating Widget - Recording Button to start recording. And you can Click the Stop Button to end recoding.Truly Recommended!\r\n2.Click the Notification Bar - Recording Button to start recording. And you can Click the Stop Button to end recoding. \r\n\r\nAny ideas please feel free to contact me.",
